msgstr "سائٹ میپس اور IndexNow"

#: src/Admin/BaiduSubmissionPage.php:34
msgid "PublishRank sitemap index"
msgstr "PublishRank سائٹ میپ انڈیکس"

#: src/Admin/BaiduSubmissionPage.php:34
msgid ""
"You can add this sitemap in Baidu’s platform when the account exposes "
